arison:p044","quote":"起家州主簿、秘書郎，轉丞，以選尚新安公主。嘗經吳郡，聞顧辟彊有名園。先不相識，乘平肩輿徑入。時辟彊方集賓友，而獻之遊歷既畢，傍若無人。辟彊勃然數之曰：「傲主人，非禮也。以貴驕士，非道也。失是二者，不足齒之傖耳。」便驅出門。獻之傲如也，不以屑意。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p044:m0016"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"尚新安公主","source_clause_binding":{"kind":"biography_family_clause","rule":"fixed_comparison_jin080_received_roles","contract_ref":"source-evidence/jin080-wangxizhi-comparison/ner-facts-template.json"}},"interpretation_note":"獻之完整附傳任官段明尚；公主個人名、父母未載。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"context":{"kind":"complete_received_biography_continuation","status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p042","c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p044"],"source_qualification":"固定比較本完整傳文承接，不取現代節題作逐字父句"}}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p044:m0016","start":16,"end":20,"surface":"新安公主","kind":"person","person_id":"5km_xxs_mfw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整所選數位比較傳文與此處角色判讀；未圖校，非武英殿底本認證。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin080-xianzhi-princess-spouse","subject_person_id":"5km_xxs_mfw","predicate":"spouse","object_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDCAE","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p042","quote":"獻之字子敬。少有盛名，而高邁不羈，雖閒居終日，容止不怠，風流為一時之冠。年數歲，嘗觀門生樗蒱，曰：「南風不競。」門生曰：「此郎亦管中窺豹，時見一斑。」獻之怒曰：「遠慚荀奉倩，近愧劉真長。」遂拂衣而去。嘗與兄徽之、操之俱詣謝安，二兄多言俗事，獻之寒溫而已。既出，客問安王氏兄弟優劣，安曰：「小者佳。」客問其故，安曰：「吉人之辭寡，以其少言，故知之。」嘗與徽之共在一室，忽然火發，徽之遽走，不遑取履。獻之神色恬然，徐呼左右扶出。夜臥齋中而有偷人入其室，盜物都盡。獻之徐曰：「偷兒，氈青我家舊物，可特置之。」群偷